#. @context: Discover status line when the site does not meet the directory's threshold yet. Stated as jant.me's rule, because a directory of your own may decide differently.
#: src/ui/dash/settings/GeneralContent.tsx
msgid "{count, plural, one {# public post} other {# public posts}}. jant.me lists a blog once it has {minCount} and its oldest is {minDays} days old."
